ich is currently undefended\n3. It prepares to potentially double rooks on the e-file with Re2\n4. It improves piece coordination and puts immediate pressure on Black's position\n5. The e5 pawn is a structural weakness I can target\n\nThis move forces Black to defend the e5 pawn and gives me the initiative in the endgame.\n\n**Answer:** R: a1-e1"}
