 with this threat\n- It places my bishop on an excellent diagonal controlling key squares\n- It improves piece coordination by bringing my bishop into a more active position\n- The bishop on f4 supports potential pawn advances and controls both sides of the board\n- It creates immediate tactical pressure\n\nAnswer: B: c7-f4"}
