 the Black King, forcing it to retreat\n- It restricts Black's pieces significantly\n- The 7th rank rook can attack Black's pawns from behind and dominate the position\n- It maintains the initiative and puts maximum pressure on Black\n\nAnswer: R: f6-f7"}
